# ⚙️ BookHub — Backend

The Express.js and Node.js backend for **BookHub**. It handles user authentication, RESTful API endpoints for study materials, database access (MongoDB), caching (Redis), background jobs (BullMQ), and real-time communication via Socket.IO.

> Looking for the frontend? See the [Frontend README](../frontend/README.md).
> Looking for the project overview? See the [Root README](../README.md).

