## 🔗 Main API Routes

### 👤 Users & Authentication

| Method   | Endpoint                     | Description                                |
| -------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| `POST`   | `/register`                  | Register a new user with a profile picture |
| `POST`   | `/login`                     | Authenticate user                          |
| `POST`   | `/logout`                    | Secure logout                              |
| `POST`   | `/refresh-token`             | Refresh JWT access token                   |
| `POST`   | `/send-verification-otp`     | Send email verification OTP                |
| `POST`   | `/verify-email-otp`          | Verify email                               |
| `POST`   | `/forgot-password-otp`       | Request password reset OTP                 |
| `POST`   | `/verify-reset-password-otp` | Verify password reset                      |
| `PATCH`  | `/change-password`           | Change account password                    |
| `PATCH`  | `/update-account-details`    | Update text details                        |
| `PATCH`  | `/update-profile-pic`        | Update avatar image                        |
| `PATCH`  | `/change-gmail`              | Update account email                       |
| `GET`    | `/get-current-user`          | Fetch logged-in user data                  |
| `GET`    | `/profile/:userName`         | Fetch a user's public profile              |
| `GET`    | `/search`                    | Search for users                           |
| `DELETE` | `/delete-account`            | Delete user account                        |

### 📝 Notes

| Method   | Endpoint                       | Description                           |
| -------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |
| `POST`   | `/upload-notes`                | Upload a new note (PDF + cover image) |
| `PATCH`  | `/update-note-details/:noteId` | Update text info                      |
| `PATCH`  | `/update-note/:noteId`         | Update files (PDF/image)              |
| `GET`    | `/get-current-note/:noteId`    | Fetch specific note details           |
| `GET`    | `/get-my-notes`                | Fetch logged-in user's notes          |
| `GET`    | `/get-user-notes/:userName`    | Fetch specific user's public notes    |
| `GET`    | `/search-notes`                | Search notes repository               |
| `GET`    | `/download-note/:noteId`       | Generate a download link for a note   |
| `DELETE` | `/delete-note/:noteId`         | Remove a note                         |

### ❤️ Likes & 💬 Comments

| Method   | Endpoint                     | Description                         |
| -------- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |
| `POST`   | `/toggle/:noteId`            | Toggle like status on a note        |
| `GET`    | `/my-likes`                  | Get all notes liked by current user |
| `GET`    | `/is-liked/:noteId`          | Check if user liked a note          |
| `GET`    | `/note/:noteId`              | Get all likes for a specific note   |
| `POST`   | `/add-comment/:noteId`       | Add a comment to a note             |
| `GET`    | `/get-comments/:noteId`      | Fetch comments for a note           |
| `PATCH`  | `/edit-comment/:commentId`   | Edit a comment                      |
| `DELETE` | `/delete-comment/:commentId` | Delete a comment                    |
| `GET`    | `/get-my-comments`           | View all comments made by the user  |

### 🤝 Connections (Followers)

| Method | Endpoint                | Description                        |
| ------ | ----------------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `POST` | `/toggle/:userId`       | Follow/unfollow a user             |
| `GET`  | `/is-following/:userId` | Check follow status                |
| `GET`  | `/followers/:userId`    | Get user's followers list          |
| `GET`  | `/following/:userId`    | Get accounts the user is following |
| `GET`  | `/my-friends`           | Get mutual connections             |
| `GET`  | `/suggestions`          | Get follow recommendations         |

### 📚 Playlists & Sharing

| Method   | Endpoint                                       | Description                            |
| -------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |
| `POST`   | `/create`                                      | Create a new playlist                  |
| `POST`   | `/add-to-playlist/:playlistId`                 | Toggle note in a playlist              |
| `PATCH`  | `/edit-playlist/:playlistId`                   | Update playlist details                |
| `PATCH`  | `/edit-playlist-item-order/:playlistId`        | Reorder notes                          |
| `GET`    | `/get-playlist/:playlistId`                    | Fetch playlist details                 |
| `GET`    | `/get-my-playlists`                            | Fetch user's own playlists             |
| `GET`    | `/get-playlist-items/:playlistId`              | View notes inside a playlist           |
| `DELETE` | `/delete-playlist/:playlistId`                 | Delete playlist                        |
| `GET`    | `/get-user-playlists/:userName`                | Fetch a user's public playlists        |
| `GET`    | `/get-user-playlists-with-note-status/:noteId` | Fetch owned playlists with note status |
| `GET`    | `/is-note-present-in-playlist/:playlistId`     | Check if a note is in a playlist       |
| `POST`   | `/:playlistId/share`                           | Share a playlist with another user     |
| `GET`    | `/editor` / `/viewer`                          | Fetch shared playlists by role         |
| `GET`    | `/:playlistId/members`                         | View playlist members                  |
| `PATCH`  | `/:playlistId/members/:userId`                 | Update a member's role                 |
| `DELETE` | `/:playlistId/members/:userId`                 | Remove a member                        |
| `DELETE` | `/:playlistId/leave`                           | Leave a shared playlist                |

> Playlist **owners** can manage playlist details and members. **Editors** can add/remove and reorder notes. **Viewers** can access shared playlists but cannot change their contents.

### 🔔 Notifications

| Method   | Endpoint                | Description                      |
| -------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------- |
| `GET`    | `/count`                | Get unread notification count    |
| `GET`    | `/unread`               | Fetch unread notifications       |
| `GET`    | `/`                     | Fetch all notifications          |
| `PATCH`  | `/read-all`             | Mark all as read                 |
| `PATCH`  | `/:notificationId/read` | Mark single notification as read |
| `DELETE` | `/:notificationId`      | Remove a notification            |

> Notifications are emitted to the recipient's Socket.IO room for live delivery. Redis stores notification counters and temporary OTP values.

### ✍️ Written Notes / Blogs

| Method   | Endpoint   | Description                                                                                       |
| -------- | ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `POST`   | `/`        | Create a written note and queue PDF generation                                                    |
| `GET`    | `/`        | Fetch the current user's written notes                                                            |
| `GET`    | `/:blogId` | Fetch a written note; non-owners receive metadata and the generated PDF URL, not editable content |
| `PATCH`  | `/:blogId` | Update a written note (owner only) and queue a new PDF when content changes                       |
| `DELETE` | `/:blogId` | Delete a written note (owner only)                                                                |

> Written-note PDFs are generated asynchronously, stored in Cloudinary, and are available for viewing or download once the status is `READY`.

